    "glossary_standard_flashcards": "Pib mus sib tham flashcard study kev sib ntsib nrog koj cov lus lo lus. cov yam ntxwv: nyem mus flip (lo lus → lub ntsiab), shuffle hom rau varied xyaum, kev nce qib kev tshawb (known vs. kev kawm), suab pronunciation kev xaiv, thiab sequential kev tshuaj xyuas. Browse dhau los ntawm daim npav at koj own pace nrog shuffle hom rau variety. XP nqi zog rau completing study kev sib ntsib. flashcard auto-khaws kev nce qib—return later mus mus ntxiv. Luam tawm physical daim npav rau offline study. Research qhia qhib recall (flashcard) yog ntau effective than passive kev tshuaj xyuas rau ntev-lo lus retention.",
    "glossary_etymology_info": "Shows txhua lo lus's origin thiab root feem. Zoo rau Tier 3 science/kev sib raug zoo studies cov lus qhov twg Greek/Latin roots (photo-, cardio-, -ology) carry meaning. Two ways mus tsim: (1) hloov 'Suav nrog lo lus roots' before tab tom tsim phau ntawv qhia lus mus get etymology hauv one batch, los yog (2) nyem 'Qhia lo lus roots' per-lo lus after tiam rau rau saum-demand roots. qib-aware: K-5 gets yooj yim wording like 'comes los ntawm Greek lo lus photo meaning light', 6-12 gets prefix/root/suffix breakdown nrog qhov chaw hom lus. Respects lub hom phiaj hom lus: glossaries tau tsim hauv Spanish get Spanish etymologies. yog tias lo lus has no meaningful etymology (proper noun, recent coinage), cov yam ntxwv gracefully skips it. Roots tshwm sim rau saum flashcard backs thiab PDF exports. cov lus qhia: etymology yog single highest-leverage retention tswv yim rau domain-tshwj xeeb cov lus.",
    "timeline_visuals_info": "Tsim AI lub cim/illustrations rau txhua sequence yam. Off by default mus khaws tiam time. Zoo rau K-5 thiab EL tub ntxhais kawm who benefit los ntawm kev pom anchors (photosynthesis stages, life cycles, historical events, size/scale sequences). Adds ~30-50 vib nas mus tiam rau 10-yam sequence siv pooled concurrency (5 at time, 3 retries per yam). duab also tshwm sim inside hauv-kev ua si draggable daim npav rau dual-coded recall. Per-yam duab tuaj yeem be regenerated los ntawm kho hom. Revising sequence drops qub duab thiab regenerates yog tias hloov stays rau saum (since revised yam no longer match qub kev pom). cov lus qhia: leave off rau abstract sequences (intensity, hierarchy theem) qhov twg generic lub cim tuaj yeem mislead; turn rau saum rau concrete events, objects, thiab procedural cov theem.",
    "glossary_language_flashcards": "Pib ob hom lus flashcard xyaum rau hom lus kev kawm. daim npav qhia: lo lus hauv lub hom phiaj hom lus → kev txhais lus hauv native hom lus (los yog reverse). suab pronunciation muaj rau ob qho hom lus. Perfect rau: ELL tub ntxhais kawm kev kawm English cov lus, world hom lus chav kawm, heritage hom lus maintenance, thiab ob hom lus education. cov yam ntxwv suav nrog: flip direction hloov (L1→L2 los yog L2→L1), pronunciation xyaum hom, thiab culturally-aware kev txhais lus. xyaum tsim: cov lus hauv context, reading fluency hauv ob qho hom lus, thiab cross-linguistic connections. kev nce qib syncs nrog regular flashcard mastery—lo lus learned hauv one hom suav across ob qho.",
    "glossary_export_standard": "Xa tawm koj cov lus flashcard as PDF luam tau. kev tawm muaj: tag nrho lo lus thiab lub ntsiab, front/rov qab daim npav layout, thiab cut kab rau yooj yim separation. Luam tawm kev xaiv: 4 daim npav per phab ntawv (large, yooj yim mus handle), 8 daim npav (tus qauv size), los yog 12 (compact). PDF yog formatted rau double-sided printing so fronts thiab backs align. Zoo rau: offline study, chav kawm sets, thiab niam txiv homework kev txhawb. cov lus qhia: Luam tawm rau saum cardstock rau durable physical flashcard.",
    "glossary_export_language": "Xa tawm ob hom lus flashcard nrog lo lus hauv ob qho hom lus. txhua daim npav qhia: lo lus hauv lub hom phiaj hom lus (front), kev txhais lus hauv native hom lus (rov qab), thiab pronunciation guide. kev txhawb dual-hom lus literacy development thiab ELL cov lus building. Luam tawm kev xaiv match tus qauv flashcard xa tawm. Perfect rau: world hom lus chav kawm, ob hom lus programs, heritage hom lus xyaum, thiab home-tsev kawm ntawv connection rau multilingual families. Ob qho hom lus tshwm sim hauv tag nrho daim npav rau consistent paired kev kawm. cov lus qhia: Siv these rau hom lus-tshwj xeeb study kev sib ntsib mus tsim cross-linguistic connections.",
    "glossary_puzzle_lang": "Xaiv which hom lus mus siv rau qhov yam ntxwv tiam. kev xaiv: primary hom lus (lo lus), translated hom lus (rau ob hom lus qhov yam ntxwvs), los yog ob qho (qib siab kev sib tw). hom lus selection affects: lo lus orientation, letter grids, thiab lo lus teb keys. Using translated hom lus kev pabs: tsim sight recognition hauv lub hom phiaj hom lus, reinforce spelling cov qauv, thiab increase exposure time. Puzzles hauv unfamiliar scripts may need larger fonts. Consider tub ntxhais kawm proficiency thaum selecting. cov lus qhia: Pib nrog primary hom lus rau lub tswv yim reinforcement, hloov mus kev txhais lus rau hom lus xyaum.",
