    "glossary_memory_game": "Pib mus sib tham Memory Match siv koj cov lus. Gameplay: daim npav pib face-down, nyem two mus flip, match lo lus nrog lub ntsiab. cov yam ntxwv: adjustable pair suav (6-12 pairs), timed los yog untimed ua si, qhab nia kev tshawb, thiab kev pom/suab kev tawm tswv yim. Cognitive benefits: working memory xyaum, cov lus reinforcement, thiab engagement dhau los ntawm kev ua si. XP awarded rau successful matches nrog bonus rau ceev. daim npav shuffle txhua kev ua si rau replay tus nqi. Ua hauj lwm nrog duab yog tias phau ntawv qhia lus muaj kev pom. cov lus qhia: Pib nrog fewer pairs rau sib tw tub ntxhais kawm, increase rau kev sib tw.",
    "glossary_crossword": "Tsim professional crossword qhov yam ntxwv los ntawm koj cov lus. cov yam ntxwv: ua nws tus kheej clue tiam los ntawm lub ntsiab, optimized lo lus placement, numbered daim phiaj nrog across/down tshooj, thiab adjustable kev nyuaj. kev tawm muaj: printable qhov yam ntxwv sheet, separate lo lus teb key, thiab digital mus sib tham version. Zoo rau: kev ntsuam xyuas (fill hauv los ntawm lub ntsiab), cov lus kev tshuaj xyuas, critical thinking (siv crossing letters as cov lus qhia), thiab txaus siab homework. AI maximizes lo lus intersections rau proper crossword structure. cov lus qhia: Review auto-tau tsim clues rau clarity before printing.",
    "glossary_matching": "Mus sib tham lo lus-lub ntsiab kev sib npaug activity. Gameplay: lo lus tshwm sim rau saum left, lub ntsiab rau saum sab xis; kos kab los yog rub mus connect pairs. cov yam ntxwv: shuffled positions txhua kev ua si, immediate kev tawm tswv yim rau saum connections, timer kev xaiv rau kev sib tw, thiab kev nce qib kev tshawb. Easier than Memory kev ua si (tag nrho pom tau) tab sis still requires kev nkag siab. XP awarded rau qhov tseeb thiab ceev. Shows correct matches hauv green, incorrect briefly highlight before retry. Zoo rau: ceev cov lus checks, kev ua si-raws kev tshuaj xyuas, thiab engagement breaks. cov lus qhia: Siv as warm-up before kev ntsuam xyuas mus activate prior knowledge.",
    "glossary_bingo": "Tsim printable Bingo daim npav nrog koj cov lus lo lus. cov yam ntxwv: randomized daim npav tiam (txhua tub ntxhais kawm gets unique daim npav), customizable daim phiaj size (3x3, 4x4, 5x5), lub ntsiab as call-out cov lus qhia, thiab styled templates. Luam tawm chav kawm teeb nrog one nyem. Zoo rau: whole-chav kawm kev tshuaj xyuas, kev xeem prep, rainy day activities, thiab end-ntawm-unit celebrations. daim npav suav nrog: free space kev xaiv, numbered rau kev tshawb, thiab xib fwb call sheet. Xa tawm as PDF rau printing. AI ensures fair lo lus distribution across tag nrho daim npav. cov lus qhia: Siv lub ntsiab as call-outs mus ua tub ntxhais kawm match meaning, tsis just recognize lo lus.",
    "glossary_play_bingo": "Pib ncaj qha digital Bingo nrog koj cov lus. cov yam ntxwv: animated daim npav tso tawm, automated calling (lub ntsiab nyeem aloud), mark plaub fab nrog nyem/tap, ua nws tus kheej win detection, thiab celebration effects. Perfect rau: smart board tso tawm, tub ntxhais kawm devices hauv chav kawm, thiab remote kev kawm engagement. xib fwb controls calling pace thiab tuaj yeem pause nyob nruab nrab calls. tub ntxhais kawm compete rau cov qauv: single kab, corners, full daim npav. XP awarded rau completing kev ua si. cov lus qhia: Project koj screen while tub ntxhais kawm ua si rau saum devices rau whole-chav kawm excitement.",
    "glossary_scramble": "Unscramble cov lus lo lus los ntawm jumbled letters. Gameplay: scrambled letters tshwm sim, type correct lo lus, advance mus tom ntej lo lus. cov yam ntxwv: cov lus qhia system (reveal letters), timer kev xaiv, kev nyuaj adjustment (easier scrambles rau beginners), thiab lub ntsiab as conntawv nyeem clues. Tsim: spelling qhov tseeb, letter pattern recognition, thiab cov lus retention. XP awarded rau txhua correct unscramble nrog ceev bonuses. cov lus qhia reduce XP tab sis keep kev nce qib moving. tag nrho phau ntawv qhia lus lo lus yog suav nrog hauv rotation. cov lus qhia: Qhia lub ntsiab alongside scrambles mus reinforce meaning during spelling xyaum.",
    "glossary_edit": "Qhib phau ntawv qhia lus editor mus hloov raws siab nyiam cov lus cov ntsiab. Editor allows: modifying lo lus names thiab lub ntsiab, adding/removing lo lus, regenerating tus kheej duab, adjusting kev txhais lus, thiab reordering lo lus. Kev hloov khaws automatically. Siv thaum: AI-tau tsim lub ntsiab need refinement, lo lus yog incorrect los yog missing, los yog adding tub ntxhais kawm-suggested cov lus. Kho hom qhia: full lo lus daim npav hauv daim ntawv teev npe saib, inline editing rau ceev kev hloov, thiab bulk actions rau ntau lo lus. cov lus qhia: Review thiab hloov raws siab nyiam AI lub ntsiab mus match koj tshwj xeeb curriculum context.",
