    "header_settings_text_bionic": "Qhib Bionic Reading, research-backed reading kev txhawb qhov ntawd bolds thawj 1-3 letters ntawm txhua lo lus. Qhov no tsim artificial fixation lub tshoj qhov ntawd kev pab eye tshais ntau efficiently across cov ntawv. Benefits: faster reading rau qee users, improved focus rau ADHD cov tub ntxhais kawm, reduced regression (re-reading), thiab zoo dua kev nkag siab rau sib tw readers. effect yog subtle tab sis tuaj yeem be transformative rau sab xis learner. Sim it rau 5-10 minutes mus pom yog tias it kev pabs koj los yog koj tub ntxhais kawm. Ua hauj lwm rau saum tag nrho tau tsim cov ntawv suav nrog simplified passages, kev sim, thiab phau ntawv qhia lus lub ntsiab.",
    "header_settings_text_reset": "Pib dua tag nrho cov ntawv kev teeb tsa mus default.",
    "header_settings_voice": "Configure cov ntawv-mus-speech suab kev teeb tsa. Xaiv los ntawm ntau AI voices (male/female, different accents), kho Speaking ceev (slower rau kev nkag siab, faster rau fluent readers), teeb volume theem, thiab kev xeem voices before selecting. These kev teeb tsa affect tag nrho nyeem-aloud cov yam ntxwv suav nrog 🔊 pob nias rau saum daim npav, Karaoke hom, thiab AlloBot's spoken responses. cov lus qhia: Sim different voices mus find one koj tub ntxhais kawm responds mus best.",
