    "quiz_local_stats_btn": "Hloov tso tawm nyob nruab nrab kev ua si kev pom thiab analytics. kev ua si saib: qhia kev sim interface, qhab nia, timers, thiab txaus siab graphics qhov ntawd tub ntxhais kawm pom. Stats saib: qhia xib fwb-only analytics suav nrog response distributions, time-mus-lo lus teb cov ncauj lus, lo lus nug-by-lo lus nug performance, thiab sib tw tub ntxhais kawm alerts. Hloov anytime without affecting gameplay. Siv stats saib mus: txheeb xyuas which lo lus nug caused kev nyuaj, spot tub ntxhais kawm who need kev txhawb, thiab ua lub sij hawm tiag instructional decisions. tub ntxhais kawm do tsis pom stats saib even yog tias projected—it qhia rau saum xib fwb device only. Return mus kev ua si saib rau celebrating correct lo lus teb thiab maintaining engagement.",
