    "dashboard_export_csv_btn": "Xa tawm tag nrho tub ntxhais kawm performance cov ncauj lus as CSV (spreadsheet) cov ntaub ntawv compatible nrog Excel, Google Sheets, thiab most gradebook system. Xa tawm muaj: tub ntxhais kawm identifiers (codenames), activity kev ua tiav timestamps, kev sim qhab nia by lo lus nug, time rau saum task, XP earned, thiab kev sib ntsib-theem aggregate metrics. kem yog labeled rau yooj yim coj los rau koj grading system. Siv rau: integrating nrog official gradebooks, tab tom tsim permanent records, cov ncauj lus analysis, thiab niam txiv communication. CSV hom preserves numerical cov ncauj lus rau sorting thiab calculations. Consider exporting after txhua major kev ntsuam xyuas rau progressive documentation.",
    "dashboard_clear_all_btn": "Lwv tag nrho tub ntxhais kawm records thiab pib dua analytics mus empty. Qhov no yog permanent thiab irreversible. tag nrho cov ncauj lus yog removed: tub ntxhais kawm identifiers, activity records, kev sim qhab nia, thiab aggregate statistics. Siv nrog extreme caution. Scenarios rau clearing: end ntawm semester pib dua, testing nrog demo cov ncauj lus, los yog starting fresh nrog tshiab chav kawm. Consider exporting before clearing mus preserve records. Confirmation requires explicit acknowledgment. After clearing, dashboard qhia no cov ncauj lus until tshiab tub ntxhais kawm join. Qhov no does tsis affect: koj tau tsim kev pab cuam, tau khaws zaj lus qhia, los yog xib fwb library. cov lus qhia: Clear only thaum absolutely necessary; archives yog usually preferable.",
    "dashboard_close_btn": "Exit dashboard phab ntsa thiab return mus main workspace. Dashboard cov ncauj lus persists—reopening qhia tib yam cov ncauj lus. Kev hloov made hauv dashboard (grading, notes) yog tau khaws automatically before closing. Siv kaw mus: return mus cov ntsiab creation, reduce kev pom kev nyuaj, los yog focus rau saum lwm tasks. Dashboard tuaj yeem be reopened anytime los ntawm header. yog tias connected mus ncaj qha kev sib ntsib, closing dashboard does tsis end kev sib ntsib—tub ntxhais kawm remain connected. Keyboard shortcut: Escape (hauv most views). Dashboard automatically closes thaum switching mus major activities. koj current saib qhov chaw yog remembered rau tom ntej opening.",
