    "alignment_standard_select": "Xaiv which tus qauv framework mus align koj cov ntsiab nrog. kev xaiv suav nrog: Feem ntau Core State tus qauv (ELA thiab Lej, tau siv by most states), tom ntej Tiam Science tus qauv (NGSS), state-tshwj xeeb tus qauv (Texas TEKS, California, Florida, etc.), AP framework, IB curriculum, thiab kev nyiam frameworks. AI retrieves current tus qauv los ntawm tau xaiv framework mus txheeb xyuas matches nrog koj cov ntsiab. Rau multi-state hoob kawmrooms los yog homeschool, Feem ntau Core provides broad applicability. tus qauv kev sib raug yog shown hauv zaj lus qhia plans thiab tuaj yeem be exported rau documentation. Framework selection yog tau khaws rau koj kev sib ntsib.",
