    "simplified_read_mode": "Return mus default reading saib without mus sib tham cov yam ntxwv. Nyeem hom provides: clean cov ntawv tso tawm, tus qauv navigation, thiab minimal interface. Siv thaum: tub ntxhais kawm should nyeem independently without kev txhawb, cov ntsiab yog at appropriate theem, los yog koj want distraction-free reading. Nyeem hom yog baseline los ntawm which lwm hom (Define, Phonics, Explain) ntxiv cov yam ntxwv. Switching hom does tsis lose koj place hauv cov ntawv. Nyeem hom ua hauj lwm nrog tag nrho kev nkag mus tau kev teeb tsa (ntsiab lus, font, overlays). Rau fluent readers, Nyeem hom yog often sufficient. cov lus qhia: Pib sib tw readers hauv kev txhawb hom, transition mus Nyeem hom as kev txawj develop.",
    "simplified_read_along": "Karaoke-hom reading hom qhov ntawd highlights txhua lo lus los yog phrase as it yog spoken aloud. Benefits: kev txhawb reading fluency by homling pace thiab prosody, kev pabs sib tw readers track qhov chaw, reinforces sight lo lus recognition, thiab provides multisensory kev nkag (kev pom + auditory). highlight xim thiab speaking suab siv koj current kev teeb tsa. Pause anytime by nyeming. Especially effective rau: early readers, ELL tub ntxhais kawm, auditory cov tub ntxhais kawm, thiab anyone practicing fluent reading. Research qhia sync suab-kev pom kev nkag strengthens lo lus recognition pathways.",
