    "simplified_phonics_mode": "Activate Phonics hom rau lo lus-theem decoding kev txhawb. Nyem any lo lus mus pom: syllable breakdown (el-e-phant), IPA phonetic transcription (/ˈɛləfənt/), suab pronunciation at adjustable ceev, thiab phoneme highlighting. xim-coded syllable stress kev pabs nrog pronunciation. cov yam ntxwv maj mam hom qhov ntawd pronounces txhua syllable separately rau sib tw decoders. kev txhawb: early readers building phonemic awareness, ELL tub ntxhais kawm kev kawm English pronunciation, thiab any tub ntxhais kawm encountering unfamiliar multisyllabic lo lus. Aligns nrog Orton-Gillingham thiab Science ntawm Reading approaches mus explicit phonics cov lus qhia.",
