    "persona_auto_send": "Qhib ua nws tus kheej cov xov submission after pause detection. thaum ON: typing stops rau 2-3 vib nas thiab cov xov sends automatically. Benefits: hands-free conversation flow, faster rov qab-thiab-forth, thiab natural dialogue rhythm. Best rau: suab-kev nkag hom, kev nkag mus tau (reduced nyeming), thiab kiv ntsuab conversations. thaum OFF: manually nyem Xa los yog press Sau. Consider environment: auto-xa yog zoo rau tus kheej work tab sis tsawg predictable hauv noisy hoob kawmrooms qhov twg pauses may be unintentional. Adjustable pause duration hauv kev teeb tsa. Pairs well nrog suab hom rau fully spoken conversations. tub ntxhais kawm may need xyaum nrog pacing initially.",
    "persona_show_hints": "Control whether suggested lo lus nug tshwm sim during persona conversations. thaum ON: AI-tau tsim lo lus nug suggestions tshwm sim below kev nkag thaj av. cov lus qhia yog: contextual (tsim rau saum current conversation), pedagogical (lub hom phiaj kev kawm objectives), thiab scaffolded (ntau kev txhawb early, tsawg later). Kev pabs: tub ntxhais kawm who struggle nrog qhib-ended lus nuging, ELL cov tub ntxhais kawm needing kab lus frames, thiab ensuring conversations stay productive. thaum OFF: tub ntxhais kawm tsim tag nrho lo lus nug independently—zoo dua rau developing lus nuging kev txawj. cov lus qhia visibility does tsis affect XP. xib fwb tuaj yeem pom hauv analytics whether tub ntxhais kawm tau siv cov lus qhia. Pib nrog cov lus qhia ON rau unfamiliar personas, then kaw as comfort grows.",
    "persona_topic_spark": "Tsim conversation starter thaum stuck. Nyem mus txais suggested cov ncauj lus los yog lo lus nug tailored mus: current persona (historically accurate rau real figures), koj qhov chaw cov ntsiab, thiab dab tsi has tsis yet been discussed. Spark suggestions aim mus: restart stalled conversations, qhib tshiab productive kaum, thiab homl zoo lus nuging. Using spark yog tsis cheating—it yog scaffold thaum needed. Sparks tuaj yeem inspire tub ntxhais kawm mus hloov thiab personalize suggestion. Ntau nyems tsim different topics. Perfect rau: conversation lulls, tub ntxhais kawm who exhaust initial lo lus nug, thiab exploring aspects tub ntxhais kawm might tsis think mus ask txog independently.",
    "persona_save_chat": "Preserve qhov no conversation rau future qhov xa mus. Saving captures: ua kom tiav transcript nrog timestamps, kev xav cov lus qhia thiab responses, thiab XP earned. Khawsd conversations tshwm sim hauv History rau: kev tshuaj xyuasing dab tsi was learned, continuing conversations later, pov thawj rau portfolios, thiab xib fwb kev ntsuam xyuas. Conversations auto-khaws at conclusion, tab sis siv tes khaws preserves mid-conversation kev nce qib. Ntau khaws tsim version snapshots. Khawsd chats tuaj yeem be: exported as cov ntawv, shared nrog xib fwb, thiab referenced hauv written assignments. cov lus qhia: Khaws before major direction kev hloov hauv case koj want mus return mus earlier topics. xib fwb tuaj yeem kev nkag tau khaws conversations dhau los ntawm dashboard.",
    "analysis_check_accuracy": "AI-tau tsim cov ntsiab tuaj yeem contain kev yuam kev. thaum enabled, adds ~5 vib nas tab sis cross-checks facts nrog Google Nrhiav. Shows [✓ verified] los yog [⚠️ unverified] markers.",
