    "escape_room_timer": "Countdown timer rau Escape Room kev paub. Time pressure tsim urgency thiab excitement while building time management kev txawj. pom tau mus tag nrho pab pawg members simultaneously. thaum timer reaches zero: kev ua si ends, current kev nce qib yog tau khaws, thiab partial kev ua tiav qhab nia yog calculated. Typical chav khiav khiav 15-30 minutes. xib fwb tuaj yeem: pause timer rau cov lus qhia, ntxiv time rau sib tw pab pawgs, los yog kho initial time hauv kev teeb tsa. Timer xim kev hloov (green mus yellow mus red) as time runs low. suab kev ceeb toom cov suab at critical thresholds (unless muted). Time remaining affects final qhab nia—faster escapes earn bonus XP.",
    "escape_room_streak": "Consecutive correct lo lus teb counter qhov ntawd nqi zog sustained qhov tseeb. txhua correct lo lus teb without mistakes increases koj streak multiplier. Streak mechanics: 3 correct = 1.5x XP, 5 correct = 2x XP, 10+ correct = 3x XP (max). One wrong lo lus teb resets streak mus zero. Qhov no teaches: carefully checking work before lus tebing, tus nqi ntawm qhov tseeb tshaj ceev, thiab building momentum dhau los ntawm focus. Streak counter yog pom tau mus whole pab pawg. Siab streaks tsim memorable moments thiab friendly competition. xib fwb pom streak cov ncauj lus hauv analytics mus txheeb xyuas ob qho careful tub ntxhais kawm thiab those who rush.",
