    "brainstorm_step_count": "Control kev ua piv ntev thiab tob. Range: 3 cov theem (ceev exploration) mus 15 cov theem (tob dive). txhua cov theem involves: AI prompt los yog response, opportunity rau tub ntxhais kawm kev nkag, thiab progressive kev nyuaj. ntau cov theem allow: deeper exploration, ntau perspectives, thiab thorough coverage. Fewer cov theem provide: focused engagement, time efficiency, thiab clear conclusions. Consider: muaj time, tub ntxhais kawm stamina, thiab cov ntsiab kev nyuaj. Kev ua pivs tuaj yeem be continued los yog wrapped up early. cov theem suav guides AI pacing—it tsim toward conclusion within limit. cov lus qhia: Pib nrog 5-7 cov theem rau most topics; ntxiv ntau rau nyuaj issues requiring nuanced exploration.",
