    "timeline_topic": "Hais kom meej different focus rau timeline tiam. By default: AI extracts primary cov ncauj lus los ntawm koj qhov chaw cov ntawv. Override mus: narrow focus mus tshwj xeeb aspect, broaden mus related context, los yog redirect mus connected cov ncauj lus. piv txwv: yog tias qhov chaw yog txog WWII, override mus Battle ntawm Midway rau tshwj xeeb focus, los yog Causes ntawm WWII rau analytical timeline. Custom topics still kos los ntawm qhov chaw cov ntsiab qhov twg relevant. Leave blank mus siv AI-detected cov ncauj lus. Custom cov ncauj lus must be related mus qhov chaw rau coherent cov txiaj ntsig. cov lus qhia: Siv kev nyiam topics mus tsim ntau timelines los ntawm tib yam qhov chaw nrog different focuses.",
    "timeline_count": "Control timeline ntev thiab kev meej. Range: 5 events (key milestones only) mus 25 events (comprehensive chronology). Fewer events: cleaner visualization, focus rau saum turning lub tshoj, easier mus memorize. ntau events: meej progression, minor events suav nrog, ua kom tiav picture. Consider: cov ntsiab scope (broad topics need ntau events), tub ntxhais kawm theem, thiab kev kawm objective. AI prioritizes most significant events thaum limited. Events tuaj yeem be edited, added, los yog removed after tiam. Mus sib tham timelines allow expanding events rau kev meej. cov lus qhia: Pib nrog 8-10 events rau balanced coverage; ntxiv ntau yog tias tub ntxhais kawm need granular kev meej.",
