    "concept_sort_categories": "Hais kom meej kev nyiam pawg labels rau sorting activity. Sau pawg names separated by commas. piv txwv: Living, Non-Living los yog Fact, Opinion los yog Cause, Effect, Ob qho. AI tsim yam qhov ntawd fit koj pawg. pawg determine: cognitive kev txawj kev xyaumd, kev nyuaj theem, thiab cov ntsiab organization. 2-3 pawg work best rau most activities. ntau pawg increase kev nyuaj. Clear, distinct pawg tsim zoo dua cov txiaj ntsig. pawg tuaj yeem be abstract (lub tswv yim) los yog concrete (piv txwv). Overlapping pawg (Ob qho kev xaiv) teach nuanced hoob kawmification. cov lus qhia: Siv tub ntxhais kawm-friendly pawg names qhov ntawd clearly communicate sorting criterion.",
