    "concept_sort_add_item": "Tsim personalized yam rau sorting activity. xib fwb cov yam ntxwv rau customizing tau tsim cov ntsiab. Sau: yam cov ntawv (dab tsi tshwm rau saum daim npav) thiab correct pawg assignment. Custom yam blend nrog AI-tau tsim yam. Siv mus: ntxiv curriculum-tshwj xeeb lo lus, suav nrog tricky edge cases, los yog personalize rau koj tub ntxhais kawm. Custom yam yog tau khaws nrog activity rau future reuse. tub ntxhais kawm pom kev nyiam yam mixed randomly nrog tau tsim ones. Adding yam does tsis tshem existing ones. Rau tub ntxhais kawm tus kheej-kev ntsuam xyuas, muaj them tsim yam thiab predict peer performance. cov lus qhia: Ntxiv yam qhov ntawd address feem ntau misconceptions los ntawm koj teaching kev paub.",
