    "group_create_input": "Name koj tshiab pawg rau organization. piv txwv: Red Team, qib siab Readers, lub rooj 3, los yog Period 2. Names should be memorable thiab appropriate rau tub ntxhais kawm saib yog tias shown. Keep names luv rau tso tawm purposes. Groups tuaj yeem be renamed later. Consider naming schemes: by ability (approaching, meeting, exceeding), by lub rooj/seating, by xim/ntsiab lus (pab pawgs), los yog by period (yog tias reusing kev sib ntsib). Group names tshwm sim hauv: tub ntxhais kawm saib (yog tias configured), analytics, thiab ncaj qha kev sib ntsib management. Avoid names qhov ntawd could embarrass tub ntxhais kawm los yog reveal ability theem publicly. Strategic naming kev pabs koj quickly txheeb xyuas thiab manage tub ntxhais kawm pawgs during ncaj qha cov lus qhia.",
