    "adventure_lock_settings": "Prevent tub ntxhais kawm los ntawm changing kev mus ncig configuration. thaum locked: kev nyuaj, turn suav, kev pom hom, thiab safety kev teeb tsa yog fixed. tub ntxhais kawm tuaj yeem only interact nrog dab neeg cov ntsiab, tsis setup kev xaiv. Recommended rau: younger tub ntxhais kawm, tus qauvized kev paub, thiab chav kawm consistency. xib fwb tuaj yeem still hloov kev teeb tsa while tub ntxhais kawm cannot. Lock status persists across kev sib ntsib. Unlock anytime los ntawm xib fwb saib mus allow modifications. kev pom indicator qhia thaum kev teeb tsa yog locked. cov lus qhia: Lock kev teeb tsa rau kev ntsuam xyuas los yog thaum tshwj xeeb parameters yog important rau zaj lus qhia.",
    "adventure_low_quality": "Hloov duab quality rau kev mus ncig kev pom. Low quality: faster tiam (2-3 vib nas vs 8-10), lower API costs, smaller cov ntaub ntawv sizes, thiab adequate rau most chav kawm siv. Siab quality: ntau meej duab, zoo dua rau printing, thiab showcase quality. Quality affects: resolution, kev meej theem, thiab artistic refinement. Low quality yog often sufficient rau instructional purposes. Siab quality yog zoo dua rau: yam ntxwvd projects, printed cov khoom siv, thiab kev pom portfolios. kev teeb tsa applies mus tshiab generations only, existing duab unchanged. cov lus qhia: Siv low quality during zaj lus qhia development, hloov mus siab rau final version.",
