    "scaffolds_item": "Tus kheej scaffold prompt los yog kab lus starter. tub ntxhais kawm pom: prompt cov ntawv thiab kev ua tiav thaj av. piv txwv: main idea yog..., One piv txwv ntawm qhov no yog..., I think qhov no happened because.... Scaffolds kev txhawb: getting started (overcoming blank phab ntawv), organization (structured thinking), thiab academic hom lus (homling kab lus cov qauv). Nyem yam hauv kho hom mus hloov prompt cov ntawv. Cov lus qhia tuaj yeem suav nrog: qhib-ended starters, fill-hauv--blank frames, los yog tshwj xeeb lo lus nug. tub ntxhais kawm ua kom tiav scaffolds by typing los yog dictating. Completed scaffolds contribute mus sau ntawv xyaum thiab tuaj yeem tsim toward full nqe lus. cov lus qhia: Pib nrog ntau structured scaffolds thiab gradually tshem kev txhawb as tub ntxhais kawm develop kev txawj.",
    "scaffolds_paragraph_frame": "Structured sau ntawv template nrog blanks rau tub ntxhais kawm kev ua tiav. Frame provides: kab lus starters, transition lo lus, thiab organizational structure. tub ntxhais kawm focus rau saum cov ntsiab while frame handles organization. piv txwv frame: main idea yog ___. One supporting kev meej yog ___. Qhov no qhia qhov ntawd ___. Frames scaffold: nqe lus structure, academic hom lus, thiab logical flow. Differentiate by frame kev nyuaj: simpler frames rau sib tw writers, ntau qhib frames rau qib siab. Frames tuaj yeem be customized los yog AI-tau tsim. Completed frames tuaj yeem be converted mus full nqe lus. Tsim toward independent nqe lus sau ntawv. cov lus qhia: Gradually tshem frame kev txhawb as tub ntxhais kawm develop kev txawj.",
