    "settings_perm_mode": "Control whether tub ntxhais kawm tuaj yeem hloov nyob nruab nrab ntau kev xaiv thiab free response. thaum enabled: tub ntxhais kawm xaiv lo lus teb hom, accommodating different strengths thiab preferences. thaum disabled: lo lus teb hom yog locked mus xib fwb kev teeb tsa, ensuring kev ntsuam xyuas consistency. Qhib rau: xyaum, tub ntxhais kawm kev xaiv activities, thiab kev nkag mus tau accommodations. Kaw rau: kev ntsuam xyuas, cov ncauj lus comparability, thiab thaum tshwj xeeb hom yog important. Qee tub ntxhais kawm prefer MCQ rau confidence; others prefer free response mus qhia thinking. hom switching does tsis affect scoring validity tab sis does affect comparability. cov lus qhia: Lock hom during formal kev ntsuam xyuas; unlock during xyaum.",
    "settings_perm_visuals": "Control tub ntxhais kawm kev nkag mus duab tiam. thaum enabled: tub ntxhais kawm tuaj yeem request AI-tau tsim kev pom, supporting kev pom cov tub ntxhais kawm thiab engagement. thaum disabled: duab tiam yog xib fwb-only, reducing API costs thiab keeping focus rau saum cov ntawv. Qhib rau: creative projects, kev pom kev txhawb needs, thiab exploratory kev kawm. Kaw rau: cov ntawv-focused zaj lus qhia, budget conservation, thiab reducing distraction. txhua duab tiam siv API credits. tub ntxhais kawm-tau tsim duab yog cov ntsiab-filtered tab sis may vary hauv quality. Analytics track tiam frequency. duab khaws mus gallery rau reuse. cov lus qhia: Qhib rau projects qhov twg visualization kev pabs; kaw thaum cov ntawv kev nkag siab yog primary lub hom phiaj.",
