    "adventure_setup_chk_freeresponse": "Qhib qhib-ended response kev nkag. thaum ON: tub ntxhais kawm type any action they want, AI adapts dab neeg accordingly, creative freedom yog maximized. thaum OFF: tub ntxhais kawm xaiv los ntawm 4 AI-tau tsim kev xaiv, structure guides kev paub. Free response tsim: composition kev txawj, creativity, agency. kev xaiv hom provides: scaffolding, guaranteed productive kev xaiv, kev nkag mus tau. Free response may lead mus unexpected dab neeg directions. AI handles most reasonable kev nkag. cov lus qhia: Pib nrog kev xaiv OFF mus teach dab neeg context, qhib later rau tub ntxhais kawm-driven exploration.",
    "adventure_setup_chk_chance": "Ntxiv tabletop RPG-hom randomness. thaum enabled: kev pheej hmooy actions trigger D20 roll, roll cov txiaj ntsig affects kev kov yeej los yog kev poob, critical successes (20) thiab failures (1) tsim memorable moments. Teaches: probability lub tswv yim, kev pheej hmoo vs. nqi zog, accepting uncertain outcomes. Roll animation qhia rau saum screen. tub ntxhais kawm kawm mus weigh odds before attempting kev pheej hmooy actions. Chance hom adds: excitement, unpredictability, thiab consequence kev kawm. Without chance: outcomes yog deterministic raws rau saum kev xaiv. cov lus qhia: Qhib rau older tub ntxhais kawm who enjoy tswv yim kev ua si thiab tuaj yeem handle random kev poob.",
    "adventure_setup_chk_story": "Simplify interface rau pure storytelling. thaum ON: kev pab cuam phab ntsa yog hidden, no stats mus track, zaj dab neeg-only kev paub. thaum OFF: full system visibility, kev pab cuam displayed, kev ua si-like interface. dab neeg hom yog best rau: younger tub ntxhais kawm, reading focus, reduced cognitive nqa los. Full hom engages: gamers, tswv yim lovers, older tub ntxhais kawm. dab neeg hom still tracks internal kev nce qib tab sis does tsis tso tawm it. Switching during kev mus ncig reveals los yog hides phab ntsa. cov lus qhia: Siv dab neeg hom rau thawj kev paub, ntxiv stats later rau tub ntxhais kawm who want kev ua si elements.",
