    "adventure_start_btn": "Pib kev mus ncig nrog configured kev teeb tsa. Starting: tsim opening qhov chaw, tsim initial kev xaiv, thiab begins zaj dab neeg. Uses tag nrho kev teeb tsa configured hauv setup phab ntsa. Starting tshiab replaces any hauv-kev nce qib kev mus ncig (khaws thawj via Resume yog tias needed). thawj qhov chaw takes 10-15 vib nas mus tsim as AI tsim initial dab neeg state. Kev mus ncig auto-khaws after txhua qhov chaw. Ntau kev mus ncigs tuaj yeem be tau khaws separately. cov lus qhia: Verify kev teeb tsa before starting since qee cannot be changed mid-kev mus ncig.",
    "adventure_resume_btn": "Return mus koj hauv-kev nce qib kev mus ncig. Resume loads: koj exact dab neeg qhov chaw, tag nrho kev xaiv made, inventory thiab kev pab cuam, thiab zaj dab neeg context. Perfect rau: multi-kev sib ntsib kev mus ncigs, continuing after breaks, thiab picking up qhov twg koj left off. Resume yog only muaj thaum tau khaws kev nce qib exists. Resume pob nias qhia: kev mus ncig title thiab kawg played timestamp. Ntau kev mus ncigs tuaj yeem be tau khaws; xaiv which mus resume. Unsaved kev nce qib since kawg auto-khaws may be lost. cov lus qhia: Kev mus ncigs auto-khaws after txhua decision, tab sis manually khaws before closing rau safety.",
