    "adventure_immersive_autoread": "Control suab narration. thaum ON: tshiab dab neeg cov ntawv yog automatically nyeem aloud siv TTS, hands-free dab neeg kev paub, kiv ntsuab suabbook feel. thaum OFF: silent reading, tub ntxhais kawm controls pace. Auto-nyeem siv: koj tau xaiv suab kev teeb tsa, appropriate dramatic pacing, thiab handles dialogue naturally. Clicking during auto-nyeem pauses. ntev passages suav nrog natural pauses. Auto-nyeem yog zoo rau: kev nkag mus tau, auditory cov tub ntxhais kawm, thiab kiv ntsuab kev paub. cov lus qhia: Qhib auto-nyeem rau whole-chav kawm kev mus ncigs, kaw rau independent reading.",
    "adventure_immersive_inventory": "Kev nkag collected yam while hauv kiv ntsuab saib. Inventory qhia: tag nrho yam acquired during kev mus ncig, yam descriptions thiab siv, thiab current kev pab cuam counts. yam may be: usable (consumables), key yam (dab neeg-important), los yog equipment (stat-affecting). Nyem yam mus siv los yog inspect. Inventory management yog part ntawm gameplay hauv system Kev ua piv hom. Qee yam yog yuav tsum tau mus kev nce qib. cov lus qhia: Check inventory regularly mus remember dab tsi kev pab cuam koj muaj muaj rau solving kev sib tw.",
