    "persona_conclude": "End conversation thiab tsim comprehensive cov ntsiab lus ntawm koj discussion. cov ntsiab lus muaj: key topics covered, historical insights gained, quality ntawm koj lo lus nug, empathy demonstrated, thiab XP earned. Qhov no cov ntsiab lus tuaj yeem be exported rau kev ntsuam xyuas, added mus tub ntxhais kawm portfolios, los yog tau siv as sau ntawv prompt rau kev xav activities.",
    "persona_save_chat": "Khaws qhov no conversation mus kev tshuaj xyuas los yog sib koom later. Khawsd chats preserve ua kom tiav dialogue, XP earned, timestamps, thiab any kev xavs. Siv tau khaws chats rau tub ntxhais kawm portfolios, kev ntsuam xyuas pov thawj, chav kawm discussions, los yog exemplar homls. Khawsd conversations tuaj yeem be exported as PDF los yog shared nrog lwm tub ntxhais kawm.",
