    "atlas_title": "AlloFlow Atlas",
    "atlas_intro": "Daim duab qhia chaw uas teeb tsa cov hub thiab nplooj pib hauv AlloFlow. Xaiv ib cheeb tsam kom pom nws phau qhia, thaj chaw, yam nrhiav tau thiab ntawv sau txog qhov chaw.",
    "atlas_footer": "Cov ntu raws registry yog tsim los ntawm cov catalog tam sim no; cov ntu xaiv thiab sib xyaw tau cim hauv daim duab. Cov lej yog cov catalog nkag tau nrhiav, tsis yog cov cuab yeej tshwj xeeb. Kev kuaj tshiab cia li qhia kev hloov ntaub ntawv.",
    "privacy_title": "Kev ceev ntiag tug thiab cov ntaub ntawv tub kawm",
    "privacy_intro": "AlloFlow tsim rau chav kawm uas saib xyuas kev ceev ntiag tug. Qhov chaw ntaub ntawv nyob ntawm storage, session transport thiab AI provider koj xaiv; daim duab no pab tsev kawm tshuaj xyuas txhua txoj kev.",
    "privacy_footer": "Nov yog cov lus piav qhia khoom siv lus yooj yim, tsis yog kev qhia cai lossis daim ntawv pov thawj. Koj lub koom haum yog tus saib xyuas FERPA, kev ceev ntiag tug, kev pom zoo, kev khaws thiab kev rho tawm.",
    "a11y_intro": "Kev siv tau tsis yog ib qho feature xwb — yog lub hom phiaj tag nrho. AlloFlow tsim rau WCAG 2.2 AA (hom phiaj, tsis yog ntawv pov thawj). Muaj axe-core, IBM Equal Access thiab veraPDF PDF/UA-1 kev kuaj hauv cov txheej txheem tsim nyog.",
    "a11y_footer": "Pom ib qho teeb meem? Qhia peb — teeb meem kev siv tau yuav tau ua ntej.",
    "oss_credits_title": "Tsim los ntawm qhov chaws qhib",
    "oss_credits_intro": "AlloFlow yog dawb thiab qhib qhov chaws (AGPL-3.0), tsim los ntawm cov haujlwm hauv qab no. Ua tsaug rau lawv cov neeg sau thiab zej zog.",
    "oss_featured_header": "Cov cuab yeej kawm uas peb txuas",
    "oss_full_list_header": "Cov tsev qiv ntawv thiab cov peev txheej qhib uas peb txuas",
    "oss_credits_footer": "Hosted AI siv tus provider hauv AI settings (xws li Gemini, OpenAI, Claude lossis OpenAI-compatible endpoint); cov kev pab no tsis yog software ntim nrog. Daim ntawv tso cai puv nyob nrog source.",
    "media_guardrails_intro": "Video Studio can track stock/open media credits in each project. We do not treat every free-stock site as open source: each asset needs its own license, source URL, and attribution record before sharing.",
