      "elephants_drink_about_1_8_of_their_bod": "Cov ntxhw haus kwvyees 1/8 ntawm lawv lub cev hnyav ua dej ib hnub. Ib tug ntxhw 12,000 phaus haus 1,500 phaus dej!",
