      "winglets": "Winglets",
      "the_upturned_wingtips_on_modern_airlin": "Cov wingtip upturned ntawm cov modern airliner (Boeing 737 MAX, Airbus A350) yog inspired ncaj qha los ntawm cov split wingtip feather ntawm cov eagle. Cov «winglet» no txo induced drag 5-7%, cawm cov airline billions hauv fuel cost ib xyoos. Lawv ua haujlwm los ntawm kev tsoo lub wingtip vortex.",
      "owl_quiet_fans": "Owl-quiet fans",
      "owl_feathers_have_a_serrated_leading_e": "Cov owl feather muaj ib lub serrated leading edge, ib lub velvety surface texture, thiab ib lub fringed trailing edge uas ua ke txo aerodynamic noise yuav luag mus rau nti. Cov engineer ntawm GE thiab Dyson mimic cov feature no hauv cov turbine blade thiab fan design, txo noise ntau dua 10 decibel.",
