      "feather_engineering": "🪶 Feather engineering",
      "a_bird_feather_is_one_of_the_most_comp": "Ib tug noog cov ploob yog ib qho ntawm cov structure complex tshaj plaws hauv qhov ntuj. Ib tug flight feather muaj:",
      "the_central_shaft_a_hollow_tube_strong": "Lub central shaft — ib lub hollow tube, muaj zog dua steel raws li qhov hnyav, ua los ntawm beta-keratin.",
      "hundreds_of_branches_growing_from_the_": "Ntau pua cov ceg loj hlob los ntawm lub shaft, tsim lub vane ntawm cov ploob.",
      "tiny_hook_like_structures_connecting_b": "Cov structure me me zoo li hook uas txuas cov ceg rau ib leeg zoo li Velcro. Ib tug nquab feather muaj ~1 lab tus hook me.",
