      "inquiry_widget_no_score_no_reveal_no_a": "Inquiry widget — tsis muaj score, tsis muaj reveal, tsis muaj answer dump. Lub energy model yog illustrative (drag ∝ m^0.67 / wingspan). V formation savings sib txawv los ntawm ~10 mus rau 30% nyob ntawm species thiab position (Lissaman & Shollenberger 1970, theoretical upper bound; cov in-flight measurement muaj xws li Weimerskirch et al. 2001 rau pelican thiab Portugal et al. 2014 rau ibis). Lub widget siv 22% ua ib qho mid estimate. Rau qhov stopover ecology tiag tiag, mus saib cov primary literature.",
      "v_formation_flying": "V formation flying",
