      "brain": "Hlwb",
      "lightest_sleep_transition_from_wakeful": "Kev pw tsaug zog sib sib zog nkaus — hloov ntawm kev tsim dheev. Qhov muag ntxeev qeeb qeeb, leeg nqaij nqig. Kev ras dheev thaum pw (myoclonic twitches) yog qhov muaj ntau. Yooj yim tsa dheev. Cov vertex sharp waves tshwm rau ntawm EEG.",
      "true_sleep_begins_core_body_temperatur": "Kev pw tsaug zog tiag pib. Lub cev qhov kub hauv nruab nrab poob, plawv dhia qeeb. Cov sleep spindles (thalamocortical discharges) tiv thaiv kev pw thiab ua kom nco cov kev txav ruaj. Cov K complexes yog cov nthwv dej loj uas teb rau cov kev txhib sab nraud.",
