      "cerebellum": "Cerebellum",
      "purkinje_cells_are_among_the_largest_n": "Cov Purkinje cells yog ib qho ntawm cov neurons loj tshaj; txhua tus tau txais ~200,000 synaptic inputs. Cerebellum cortex muaj 3 txheej: molecular, Purkinje, thiab granular. Kev tshawb fawb tshiab qhia cov luag haujlwm hauv kev paub, kev xav, thiab lus.",
      "brainstem_midbrain_pons_medulla": "Brainstem (midbrain, pons, medulla oblongata)",
      "contains_nuclei_for_cranial_nerves_iii": "Muaj cov nuclei rau cov hlab ntsha taub hau III–XII. Reticular activating system (RAS) yog lub hlwb «lub switch qhib» — kev puas tsuaj ua rau coma. Pyramidal crossing hauv medulla: kev hla motor piav qhia txog kev tswj motor sab tim.",
      "hippocampus": "Hippocampus",
      "memory_replay_during_sleep_hippocampal": "Kev rov ua nco thaum pw: cov neurons hippocampus «rov ua» cov kev paub nruab hnub thaum N3 pw, hloov cov nco mus rau neocortex. Cov grid cells hauv entorhinal cortex muab cov coordinates chaw rau cov place cells hippocampus.",
      "amygdala": "Amygdala",
      "fear_conditioning_pathway_auditory_cor": "Txoj kev fear conditioning: auditory cortex → lateral amygdala → central amygdala → hypothalamus (kev teb rau kev nyuaj siab) + PAG (khov). Cov kev sib cuam tshuam amygdala-prefrontal ua kom tswj tau kev xav — lub hauv paus ntawm cognitive behavioral therapy (CBT).",
