      "the_whole_point_of_place_value_made_ta": "Tag nrho lub ntsiab lus ntawm place value ua kom KOV TAU. 10 ones = 1 ten; 10 tens = 1 hundred; 10 hundreds = 1 thousand. Kev regrouping (carrying / borrowing) yuav pom tseeb thaum koj yuav tsum pauv cov block ntawm tes.",
