      "soroban_japanese_and_suanpan_chinese_a": "Soroban (Nyij Pooj) thiab Suanpan (Suav) tseem raug qhia — cov neeg siv txawj tuaj yeem xam sai dua lub calculator rau ntau qhov teebmeem. Txhua rod yog ib qho place value; qhov xwm txheej ntawm cov bead YOG tus lej. Concrete mus rau mental hauv ob peb lub hlis.",
      "slide_rule_logarithms_in_your_hand": "Slide Rule — logarithms hauv koj txhais tes",
      "how_engineers_multiplied_before_electr": "Yuav ua li cas cov engineer muab sib npaug ua ntej muaj electronic calculators: sib npaug cov logarithmic scale, nyeem cov lus teb. Apollo 11 (1969) ua orbital math nrog slide rules. Raug hloov coob thaum HP-35 tawm los xyoo 1972 xwb.",
      "quiz_graded_place_value_arithmetic": "Kev Xeem — place value + arithmetic uas muaj qhab nia",
      "ccss_1_nbt_2_nbt_3_nbt_4_nbt_progressi": "CCSS 1.NBT, 2.NBT, 3.NBT, 4.NBT progression. Kev sib xyaw concrete-pictorial-abstract sequencing (CPA, Bruner 1966) yog tus nqaj qaum ntawm txhua lub elementary math curriculum uas tsim tau zoo.",
      "ten_frames_the_k_2_number_sense_workho": "Ten Frames — tus tub zog number sense rau K-2",
      "a_5_by_2_grid_fill_cells_to_show_a_num": "Ib daim 5-by-2 grid. Sau cov cell los qhia ib tug lej. Subitizing (paub tam sim ntawd yam tsis suav) loj hlob ntawm no. CCSS K.OA.A.4: cov lus nug \"dab tsi ua tau 10?\" yog lub qhov rooj mus rau txhua yam arithmetic fluency tom qab.",
      "two_color_counters_integers_concrete": "Two-Color Counters — integers concrete",
      "yellow_1_red_1_a_yellow_red_pair_0_a_z": "Daj = +1; liab = −1. Ib khub daj + liab = 0 (ib qho \"zero pair\"). Tus qauv concrete tshaj plaws los nkag siab negative numbers thiab integer arithmetic. CCSS 6.NS.C.5, 7.NS.A.1.",
      "place_value_disks_bridge_to_algorithm": "Place-Value Disks — tus choj mus rau algorithm",
      "each_disk_labeled_with_its_value_1_10_": "Txhua lub disk muaj label nrog nws tus nqi (1, 10, 100, 1000). Txav 10 lub disk ntawm ib hom los pauv rau 1 lub ntawm hom tom ntej. Tus choj conceptual los ntawm cov block ntiag mus rau standard algorithm. CCSS 4.NBT.B.4.",
      "hundreds_chart_count_pattern_and_skip": "Hundreds Chart — suav, pattern, thiab skip",
      "a_10x10_grid_of_1_100_click_to_highlig": "Ib daim 10x10 grid ntawm 1-100. Nias los highlight cov cell. Cov skip-count overlay qhia cov pattern multiplication. CCSS 2.NBT.A.2: skip-counting los ntawm 5s, 10s, 100s.",
      "pattern_blocks_fractions_symmetry": "Pattern Blocks — fractions + symmetry",
      "hexagon_trapezoid_rhombus_triangle_squ": "Hexagon, trapezoid, rhombus, triangle, square, rhombus nqaim. 2 trapezoids = 1 hexagon (yog li 1 trapezoid = 1/2 hex). 3 rhombi = 1 hex (yog li 1 rhombus = 1/3). 6 triangles = 1 hex (yog li 1 triangle = 1/6).",
