      "equal_length_bars_partitioned_into_hal": "Cov bar sib npaug ntev uas faib ua halves, thirds, fourths, sixths, eighths, twelfths. Sib tsub los piv. Nrhiav cov equivalent los ntawm qhov muag. Tus cuab yeej ib leeg zoo tshaj rau fraction equivalence (3.NF, 4.NF).",
