      "a_tile_for_1_unit_x_variable_x_square_": "Ib tile rau 1 (unit), x (variable), x² (square). Ob xim: positive thiab negative. Ua qauv cov expression xws li 2x + 3 los yog factor quadratics los ntawm kev tso tiles ua rectangles. CCSS 7.EE, 8.EE.",
