      "nautilus_shell_trade": "Nautilus Shell Trade",
      "nautilus_shells_are_divided_into_chamb": "Nautilus shells are divided into chambers connected by a tube called the siphuncle. By pumping fluid through it, the animal adjusts buoyancy.",
