      "tethered_underwater_robot_with_manipul": "Tethered underwater robot with manipulator arms + HD cameras + sensors. Operated from a surface ship.",
      "tetrodotoxin_for_moderate_to_severe_ca": "Tetrodotoxin for moderate to severe cancer pain: a randomized double blind multicenter trial",
      "tetrodotoxin_from_blue_ringed_octopus_": "Tetrodotoxin from blue-ringed octopus venom — and similar compounds from other cephalopods — show promise as non-opioid pain medications in clinical trials.",
      "tetrodotoxin_from_blue_ringed_octopuse": "Tetrodotoxin from blue-ringed octopuses is being investigated as a non-opioid pain medication for cancer (Tectin/Tetrodin). Phase 3 clinical trials underway.",
      "tetrodotoxin_pain_medication_tectin_te": "Tetrodotoxin pain medication (Tectin/Tetrodin) is in Phase 3 clinical trials for cancer pain. Approval in Canada (2018) for cancer pain established it as a real biomedical translation.",
      "tetrodotoxin_the_most_poisonous_substa": "Tetrodotoxin: the most poisonous substance in the world?",
