      "bacteria_reproduce_in_minutes_they_ada": "Bacteria reproduce in minutes — they adapt to climate shifts essentially instantly. Whales reproduce every few years — they may not be able to keep up with century-scale change. Most large mammals and birds are in this \"too slow to adapt\" category.",
      "barbara_mcclintock": "Barbara McClintock",
