      "daily_needs_calculator_nam_adequate_in": "Daily-needs calculator (NAM Adequate Intake by age/sex), self-check quiz with the 8-point urine-color scale (ACSM/Armstrong), beverage comparison (water vs sports drink vs soda — sodium, sugar, hydration efficacy), and a sweat-rate calculator for student athletes (NATA standard). Physiology-first framing: hydration as body function, never appetite suppression.",
