  "readinglib_opt2_body": "Qhib ib phau ntawv thiab nias 🌐 Txhais. Ua hauj lwm txawm rau hom lus StoryWeaver tsis luam tawm (Somali, Ukrainian, ...), thiab nyeem-nruam tseem ua haujlwm. Cov ntawv nyeem yog AI-tsim - tsis tau tshuaj xyuas los ntawm tus tshaj tawm - thiab cov lus piav qhia tsuas yog muaj nyob ntawm tus thawj. Qhov zoo tshaj plaws rau kev txhawb nqa tshiab niaj hnub no; khub cov menyuam kawm ntawv nrog tus thawj thaum koj tuaj yeem ua tau.",
  "readinglib_opt2_title": "Kev txhais lus AI Instant - txhua yam lus, tam sim no",
  "readinglib_opt3_body": "StoryWeaver tshaj tawm ua 300+ hom lus. Ib qho ntawm lawv tuaj yeem muab ntxiv rau hauv lub tsev qiv ntawv no nrog cov ntawv pov thawj (thiab cov lus piav qhia qhov twg nws muaj) hauv kev hloov tshiab app ceev - qhia koj tus neeg saib xyuas AlloFlow hom lus koj xav tau.",
